%AmtPtpDeviceSpiKm.DeviceDesc%=AmtPtpDeviceSpiKm_Device, SPI\VID_05ac&PID_0272&MI_02
%AmtPtpDeviceSpiKm.DeviceDesc%=AmtPtpDeviceSpiKm_Device, SPI\VID_05ac&PID_0273&MI_02
